<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd">
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><head><meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" />
</head><body>

<p>Dear ${managername} ,</p>

<p>${requestername} would like to request a cash advance of ${totalword} ${currencyname} (${currencysign} ${requestedamount}) to cover ${purpose}.</p>
<p>I propose to repay the advance over month(s), and I authorize the company to deduct the amount of ${currencysign} ${requestedamount} from my salary until the advance is fully paid.</p>

<p>Click <a href="${url}" title="View Cash Advance">here</a>  to view the Cash Advance where you can approve or reject it.</p>

<p>Thank you for your consideration.</p>

</body></html>